["root",{"sectPr":{"pgSz":{"w":892,"h":1127},"pgMar":{"top":48,"bottom":48,"left":72,"right":72,"header":56.73,"footer":66.13,"gutter":0}}},["h1",{"uuid":"mv0psranfdkcmhzuir"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"第22章 会议管理：少开会、开短会、开好会"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0w1qsne473mkuj0c9"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"这一章讲怎么少开会、开短会、开好会：先判断一个会能不能不开，要开的会在会前写清目标和议程，高频同步用 15 分钟站会，会上按议程控场，会后当天发纪要；线上会和会议礼仪放在最后。按这个顺序看，也可以只挑自己用得上的那条。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv0psranox1ge2q77qg"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h2",{"uuid":"mv0psran5ucv6yh672w"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"极高性价比"]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0psransszu2kt1bo"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"1. 开会前先判断能不能不开，能用文档或消息解决的就不开会"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0psranj5titc0bto"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：时间精力\n证据等级：B"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152jolh85b4u4t7fq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 开会要占用每个参会者的时间，而多数信息同步和简单讨论用文档、群消息或一对一沟通就能完成。开之前先过三关：有没有明确要解决的问题或决定、有没有更省时间的方式、这些人是不是非到不可；写不出目标就不开。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152jom0y1mikd115l"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"zfcmg1ev2aj","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152jomblbn1skwj54"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"信息同步、征求意见、只涉及两个人的事，用文档、群消息或一对一沟通替代，异步看完再汇总。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"zfcmg1ev2aj","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152jom14edbfla14jp"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"只为「被告知」的人不用来，会后发纪要即可。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"zfcmg1ev2aj","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152jom9yx9nxk1cpq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"确实需要当面讨论的再安排会，并控制人数和时间。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152jonj9js4zrku3"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"qpk53f9qye","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152jona25a9n03j0h"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"中共中央办公厅、国务院办公厅（2019）. 关于解决形式主义突出问题为基层减负的通知（新华网）. https://www.xinhuanet.com/politics/2019-03/11/c_1210079118.htm"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"qpk53f9qye","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152jon1jl002orppm"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Microsoft（2023）. 2023 Work Trend Index: Annual Report. https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/worklab/we-can-not-keep-up-with-work-but-ai-can-help"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152jon3ldhdkcbqok"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 「少开会、开短会」是党政机关精简会议的要求，企业没有统一的强制规定，能不能减少取决于团队文化和上级习惯；微软 2023 年度工作趋势指数对 31 个国家约 3.1 万名受访者的线上问卷显示低效会议排生产力干扰第一位，但这是受访白领的自评，不代表所有行业。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv15442p0g9290o2hqr6"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0psrax6mv1pea9oor"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"2. 会前写清目标、议程和参会人，只叫与议题相关的人"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0psraxozjiq7hxwdk"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：时间精力\n证据等级：B"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152f2ix1om9o4jp2"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 决定要开会之后，会前把三件事定清楚：要达成什么、按什么议程走、谁来参加。目标要写成「动词+结果」——写「确定 Q4 迭代的 3 个核心功能」，不写「讨论一下产品规划」；参会人只叫能拍板、要执行、能提供关键信息的人，只为知情的不来。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152f2ikgn2y08fsg"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"6n9nrts029w","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152f2j2jviz9p056j"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"议程写明每个议题的名称、时长、引导人，并注明是同步、讨论还是做决定；材料提前发出，会上直接讨论。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"6n9nrts029w","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152f2jsaaa4592kjs"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"只需要知道结果的参会人，会后发纪要。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"6n9nrts029w","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152f2jpijxynooqa8"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"不同议题需要不同的人时，在议程里标注谁参加哪一段。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152f2kmu01ikmuzi"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"lt3c80skwtl","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152f2k3ouw0gak962"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Amazon（2018）. 2017 Letter to Shareholders. https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/2017-letter-to-shareholders"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"lt3c80skwtl","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152f2kbbxkgv4bf8m"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Scrum Guides（2020）. The Scrum Guide. https://scrumguides.org/scrum-guide.html"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152f2kjz19sd7yfb8"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 亚马逊提倡用六页备忘录代替 PPT 是其内部做法，更适合需要充分论证的决策会；Scrum 指南面向软件开发团队，其他团队可借鉴。小会、短会不必准备这么细，人多的会、要拍板的会准备收益更大。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv1542i69r2wx3s0llj"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0psrbak3z5gpo07sj"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"3. 用15分钟站会做进度同步，每人说进展、计划和阻碍"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0psrbaip0032kj8v"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：极高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：时间精力\n证据等级：B"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152ai6hgqlq9tpx5u"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 需要高频同步进展的团队，可以用站会代替长会：固定时间、站着开、控制在 15 分钟内，每人只讲三句——上次做了什么、接下来做什么、遇到什么阻碍。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152ai66r6b5wgafs7"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"tksxfrw44w","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152ai754c3j3uvypw"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"固定时间和地点，到点就开，不展开讨论细节；要细谈的问题会后单独聊。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"tksxfrw44w","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152ai74qhqutwnof"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"每个人对着团队讲，不是向主持人汇报；领导少插话。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"tksxfrw44w","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152ai7skf7mwczlx8"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"常见走样是变成汇报会、细节讨论会或流水账：降频、只讲重点和风险，或让成员之间互相说。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152ai86gq2c2bn7p5"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"rtmgk1f0fem","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv152ai88zi1fuurbbn"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Scrum Guides（2020）. The Scrum Guide. https://scrumguides.org/scrum-guide.html"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv152ai8po0pleh4t9"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 不是所有团队都需要每日同步，一周一次够的就不必每天开，人多可以分组；站会容易流于形式，能不能保留取决于它是否带来价值，没有统一的量化标准。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv154094wvmj7wads3"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h2",{"uuid":"mv0psrbx7y26gcn0or9"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"高性价比"]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0psrbx04fokiwalr8f"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"4. 当主持人时按议程控场，跑题就拉回、到点就结束"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0psrbyr2jybt6pq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=中\n口径：时间精力\n证据等级：B"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv1523t4csegb4vl0y"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 会议跑题、少数人讲个不停、讨论半天没有结论，是常见的低效来源。主持人负责三件事：开场说清目标和时长、有人跑题就记下来再拉回、每个议题结束做一句小结并按时散会。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv1523t593d4ol9m6r8"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"6xu91q7omrr","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1523t5h19miaev0lf"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"控制单人发言时长，给没说话的人机会；议题差不多时归纳分歧、推动做决定。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"6xu91q7omrr","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1523t631cwoq9uj1f"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"话多：礼貌打断，请对方讲核心观点；抬杠：不争论，记下意见继续推进。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"6xu91q7omrr","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1523t63lurpc5faxz"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"沉默：提具体问题，不用「你怎么看」这类宽泛问题。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv1523t6ch16fh8hr45"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"s89kovftvxq","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1523t6m2w1ooezay"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Jay, A.（1976）. How to Run a Meeting. Harvard Business Review. https://cfe.smhs.gwu.edu/sites/g/files/zaskib506/files/2021-11/How%20To%20Run%20a%20Meeting%20%28Harvard%20Business%20Review%29.pdf"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"s89kovftvxq","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1523t6j2e4rrgc1ps"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Microsoft（2023）. 2023 Work Trend Index: Annual Report. https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/worklab/we-can-not-keep-up-with-work-but-ai-can-help"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv1523t713m1xbqpgu6j"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 控场需要练习，创意讨论类的会要留发散空间；这篇《哈佛商业评论》文章发表于 1976 年，部分做法针对线下会议。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv153y1d9w72v1gil5m"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0psrcsjl2vpnnlsq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"5. 会后当天发纪要，写明结论、行动项、负责人和截止时间"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0psrcsga2umrr7uuo"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：时间精力\n证据等级：B"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151y36uu23eyxucpr"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 会议的价值看结论有没有落地。会后当天发一份简短纪要：定了什么、谁负责、什么时间完成；行动项要落到具体的人和日期，「尽快」「下周」这类表述不行。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151y36u641bmugyt"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"9qrgwo5wph6","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151y375yv2wi6633b"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"只写结论和行动项，不写讨论过程；发给参会人员和需要知道结果的人。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"9qrgwo5wph6","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151y37c61ffezumip"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"到了截止时间确认进度，未完成问明原因和新时间，由会议组织者或主持人跟进。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"9qrgwo5wph6","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151y37het4mouvrif"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"小会、短会不必写正式纪要，在群里几句话把结论和行动项说清即可。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151y37eu6wp3lxh26"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"khpq3uql5qs","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151y38ccmjdkeryxq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"中共中央办公厅、国务院办公厅（2012）. 党政机关公文处理工作条例，第八条. https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/2013-02/22/content_2640088.htm"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151y38zg4iwfm95q"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 该条例把「纪要」定义为「记载会议主要情况和议定事项」，说明纪要写的是情况和议定事项而不是讨论过程，但它适用于党政机关，企业只可参照；也没有官方数据能衡量纪要为团队挽回多少时间。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv153x1v8x2lqenxowj"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0psrzo1vhetx2xqxk"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"6. 跟领导开会前准备数据、结论和备选方案，会上先讲结论"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0psrzp0t9oh91v1glb"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：高\n成本：钱=0 时间=中 精力=中\n口径：职业自由\n证据等级：B"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151udm6gdnknx2e7u"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 和领导开会关系到工作推进和评价。会前把要说的写成提纲、用数据代替形容词（把「效果不错」换成「用户增长 30%」这类可核对的结果）、带上至少两个备选方案，会上先讲结论再展开细节。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151udnfbctv5wd6z"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"qe3eq6fc48e","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151udnvpmph9i3ckq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"预判领导可能追问的问题，提前准备答案；进展和问题如实说，同时给出应对方案。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"qe3eq6fc48e","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151udnzscahtqc0ge"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"被批评先听完，是自己的问题就认下来，有误会等对方说完再补充。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"qe3eq6fc48e","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151udoe2y5puxi56h"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"会后记下定了什么，尽快推进，在领导追问前反馈；重要事项书面确认一遍。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151udozas37maf6in"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"woxlvsf52xg","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151udowgohl6k66z"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Gabarro, J. J., & Kotter, J. P.（2005）. Managing Your Boss. Harvard Business Review. https://hbr.org/2005/01/managing-your-boss"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151udpnwdms3tldzg"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 这篇文章的核心是理解上司的目标、压力和做事方式，属于经验总结而不是可量化的结论；不同上司偏好不同，用数据也需要平时积累，临时凑数据反而容易出错。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv153vr6nvbkoctdiub"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h2",{"uuid":"mv0pss19gqfqoggdshm"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"一般性价比"]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0pss1a7btmc2xllk"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"7. 线上会提前测试设备、进会静音、共享前关窗、迟到早退打招呼，并控制时长"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0pss1aqrwtz3ed059"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：一般\n成本：钱=少 时间=中 精力=中\n口径：时间精力\n证据等级：C"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151nxxvr3b8rmj36o"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 线上会省了路上时间，也带来新问题：设备出状况、注意力分散、冷场。会前测试麦克风、摄像头和网络（重要的会提前十分钟）、明确主持人和议程；会上到点就开、能开摄像头就开、进会先静音；共享屏幕前先关掉聊天窗口和私密文件；迟到进会先道歉，要早退提前说一声，别悄悄退出。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv1mx3yygtu3jezyomq"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"aqzxfozvk7","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1mx3yzw46qltycqva"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"长时间单人讲解时插入互动，提问或点名让人发言。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"aqzxfozvk7","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1mx3yzbmqimowzh6l"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"参会的人找安静地方、进会先静音、要发言再开麦、开会时不做别的事。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"aqzxfozvk7","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1mx3yz7a6yrcisoia"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"共享屏幕前先关掉微信、邮箱和私密文件；迟到进会先说「抱歉迟到」，中途要退在聊天框留一句「我先撤，会议纪要发我」。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"aqzxfozvk7","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv1mx3z00tvjckmu6k0j"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"超过一小时安排休息；涉及重要决策、复杂问题或建立信任时，尽量改线下沟通。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151nxyhlevk91fns"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"09khp51vzeqb","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151nxzpy0flpqja7d"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health（2022）. Videoconference Fatigue: A Conceptual Analysis. https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8871528/"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"09khp51vzeqb","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151nxz95zk97r2sm5"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Microsoft（2023）. 2023 Work Trend Index: Annual Report. https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/worklab/we-can-not-keep-up-with-work-but-ai-can-help"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151nxzvw184vmy4k"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 视频会议疲劳是理论分析文章而不是大规模实验，具体效果因人而异；线上会难以完全替代面对面，重要决策、复杂问题或建立信任时线下通常更合适。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv153qpydxbun1yv7dk"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["h3",{"uuid":"mv0pss3urqizo1vstes"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"8. 会上守基本礼仪，不迟到、不打断、不翻旧账、不人身攻击"]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0pss3v7f36a1iw8k9"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"性价比：一般\n成本：钱=0 时间=少 精力=低\n口径：职业寿命\n证据等级：C"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151jmnuuo9wp3jovr"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"说人话："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 会议是公开场合，你的表现会被同事和上级看到。准时到场、不玩手机、别人发言听完再说、不打断、不小声议论、发言面对大家；当众给领导下不来台、当众批评同事、翻旧账、抢话这几件事都别做。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151jmne7lv74t5eyf"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"怎么做："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"pktyicbt26o","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151jmo8gdp81uib0w"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"有不同意见会后单独说，发现问题私下沟通。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"pktyicbt26o","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151jmp285c80u1zp2h"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"讨论只谈当前的事，不往前翻。"]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"pktyicbt26o","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151jmplutzo1qrmqr"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"给每个人发言机会，一个人不讲太久。"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151jmpmp5li1tv8oi"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"来源："]]],["p",{"list":{"listId":"f5b3r8ifqdf","isOrdered":false,"level":0,"listStyle":{"format":"bullet","text":"●","align":"left"}},"uuid":"mv151jmq4mevo6zvmka"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},"Porath, C. L., & Erez, A.（2007）. Does Rudeness Really Matter? The Effects of Rudeness on Task Performance and Helpfulness. Academy of Management Journal. https://people.uncw.edu/hakanr/documents/EffectsofRudeness.pdf"]]],["p",{"uuid":"mv151jmqb8g05dhi6fu"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"限制与争议："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 该研究的对象是实验场景下的被试，结论能否完全推到真实职场要看具体环境；不同公司文化差别很大，有些公司不讲究这些，不必过度揣测。"]]],["hr",{"uuid":"mv0pss6s22zdm4x4v9s"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"data-type":"leaf"},""]]],["p",{"blockquote":true,"uuid":"mv0uf3pa5ualjzuo7rk"},["span",{"data-type":"text"},["span",{"bold":true,"data-type":"leaf"},"本章小结："],["span",{"data-type":"leaf"}," 会议的价值取决于必要性和落地情况。可以核对的几点：一是开会前先判断能不能不开，能用文档或消息解决的就不开；二是要开的会写清目标、议程和参会人，只叫与议题相关的人；三是高频同步可用 15 分钟站会，每人只说进展、计划和阻碍；四是会后当天发纪要，写明结论、行动项、负责人和截止时间；五是线上会提前测试设备、控制时长，重要决策和复杂问题尽量线下沟通。"]]]]